e] [17592186097318 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535133 true] [17592186097318 1100 "${\\int }_{1}^{9}⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,1⟩\\text{d}t=$" 13194139535133 true] [17592186097318 1100 "What is $∫_{1}^{9}⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}, 1⟩dt$?" 13194139535133 false] [17592186097318 1145 "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{9}⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,1⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{1}^{9}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{9}1\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{9},\\,t\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{9}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\sqrt{9}-\\sqrt{1},\\,9-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,8⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535133 true] [17592186332914 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332915 13194139535133 true] [17592186332914 1089 "q-123320" 13194139535133 true] [17592186332914 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535133 true] [17592186332914 1100 "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" 13194139535133 true] [17592186332914 1113 #uuid "83aa510b-e988-5498-be95-547a695eb498" 13194139535133 true] [17592186332914 1145 "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int {csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." 13194139535133 true] [17592186332915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332916 13194139535133 true] [17592186332915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332917 13194139535133 true] [17592186332915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332918 13194139535133 true] [17592